    {
      "id": "qddc6a62f5f",
      "text": "A particle starts from rest at the origin with constant acceleration 2 m/s² along x and 1 m/s² along y. Find its position after 4 s.",
      "owner_label": null,
      "authored": false,
      "subtopic": "Constant acceleration in a plane",
      "hint": "Use s = ½at² for each direction.",
      "steps": [
        "x = ½ × 2 × 4² = 16 m.",
        "y = ½ × 1 × 4² = 8 m, so the position is (16 m, 8 m)."
      ],
      "answer": "(16 m, 8 m)",
      "visual": "<figure data-role=\"visual\"><svg role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 360 240\" aria-labelledby=\"t-b-qddc6a62f5f d-b-qddc6a62f5f\"><title id=\"t-b-qddc6a62f5f\">Position after 4 s</title><desc id=\"d-b-qddc6a62f5f\">Position vector with components 16 m and 8 m.</desc><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"206.0\" x2=\"352\" y2=\"206.0\" stroke=\"#999\"/><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"34.0\" y2=\"232\" stroke=\"#999\"/><text x=\"338\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12\">x</text><text x=\"40.0\" y=\"18\" font-size=\"12\">y</text><defs><marker id=\"arrow-b-qddc6a62f5f\" markerUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" markerWidth=\"9\" markerHeight=\"9\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"4.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L9,4.5 L0,9 z\" fill=\"#2c4fb8\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"206.0\" x2=\"326.0\" y2=\"206.0\" stroke=\"#2c4fb8\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-b-qddc6a62f5f)\"/><text x=\"184.0\" y=\"202.0\" font-size=\"12\">16 m</text><line x1=\"326.0\" y1=\"206.0\" x2=\"326.0\" y2=\"60.0\" stroke=\"#2c4fb8\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-b-qddc6a62f5f)\"/><text x=\"330.0\" y=\"129.0\" font-size=\"12\">8 m</text><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"206.0\" x2=\"326.0\" y2=\"60.0\" stroke=\"#2c4fb8\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-b-qddc6a62f5f)\"/><text x=\"184.0\" y=\"129.0\" font-size=\"12\">r</text></svg><figcaption>Position after 4 s</figcaption></figure>",
      "source_identity": null,
      "learner_location": "pages/constant-acceleration-in-a-plane.html#qddc6a62f5f"
    },
    {
      "id": "q8e8f4d3a1c",
      "text": "A particle has initial velocity 3 m/s along x and constant acceleration 2 m/s² along y. Find its speed at t = 2 s.",
      "owner_label": null,
      "authored": false,
      "subtopic": "Constant acceleration in a plane",
      "hint": "Only the y-velocity changes.",
      "steps": [
        "vₓ stays 3 m/s; v_y = 0 + 2 × 2 = 4 m/s.",
        "Speed = √(3² + 4²) = 5 m/s."
      ],
      "answer": "5 m/s",
      "visual": "<figure data-role=\"visual\"><svg role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 360 240\" aria-labelledby=\"t-b-q8e8f4d3a1c d-b-q8e8f4d3a1c\"><title id=\"t-b-q8e8f4d3a1c\">Velocity at 2 s</title><desc id=\"d-b-q8e8f4d3a1c\">Velocity components 3 and 4 m/s and the resultant.</desc><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"206.0\" x2=\"352\" y2=\"206.0\" stroke=\"#999\"/><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"34.0\" y2=\"232\" stroke=\"#999\"/><text x=\"338\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12\">x</text><text x=\"40.0\" y=\"18\" font-size=\"12\">y</text><defs><marker id=\"arrow-b-q8e8f4d3a1c\" markerUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" markerWidth=\"9\" markerHeight=\"9\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"4.5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L9,4.5 L0,9 z\" fill=\"#2c4fb8\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"206.0\" x2=\"163.0\" y2=\"206.0\" stroke=\"#2c4fb8\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-b-q8e8f4d3a1c)\"/><text x=\"102.5\" y=\"202.0\" font-size=\"12\">3 m/s</text><line x1=\"163.0\" y1=\"206.0\" x2=\"163.0\" y2=\"34.0\" stroke=\"#2c4fb8\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-b-q8e8f4d3a1c)\"/><text x=\"167.0\" y=\"116.0\" font-size=\"12\">4 m/s</text><line x1=\"34.0\" y1=\"206.0\" x2=\"163.0\" y2=\"34.0\" stroke=\"#2c4fb8\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow-b-q8e8f4d3a1c)\"/><text x=\"102.5\" y=\"116.0\" font-size=\"12\">v</text></svg><figcaption>Velocity at 2 s</figcaption></figure>",
      "source_identity": null,
      "learner_location": "pages/constant-acceleration-in-a-plane.html#q8e8f4d3a1c"
    },
    {
      "id": "q0b6c23e837",
      "text": "A ball is thrown with speed 20 m/s at 30° above the horizontal. Find the time of flight. Take g = 10 m/s².",
      "owner_label": "Q15",
      "authored": false,
      "subtopic": "Projectiles: time of flight, height and range",
      "hint": "Find the vertical component of the launch velocity.",
      "steps": [
        "u_y = 20 × sin 30° = 10 m/s.",
        "T = 2u_y / g = 2 × 10 / 10 = 2 s."
      ],
      "answer": "2 s",
